Chiang Kai-shek is a young officer from Zhejiang. He was part of the *Tongmenghui* and then rejoined Sun Yat-sen during the *Constitutional Protection Movement*.

He was with Sun Yat-sen during Chen Jiongming's revolt on the *SS Yongfeng* and became sort of a protege to Sun, which he seems have not forgotten and recognized his military talents.

Chiang Kai-shek now controls the Whampoa Military Academy, influencing many young officers in the party and strengthening his influence. Although, he has guaranteed that the Academy will operate smoothly.
